{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"more_loop\": \"X\",\n  \"x_loops\": [\n    \"S04→S07→S09→S10→S11：S04已经想到回去可能又要忍让；S07再次摆在想找回亲近与不愿再受气之间；S09又追问自己是否因为孤单而愿意重新受气；S10、S11再回到舍不得亲近却不敢回去、不能只凭希望回去的矛盾。同一个去留难题被连续多次重新摆出来。\",\n    \"S06→S08→S10：想起从前的亲近而感到温暖，随后想到现实中无人陪伴又陷入不安，S10再次回到暖意、酸楚和生活不踏实的状态。虽然S08提出了回忆无法代替现实陪伴的新认识，但情绪摆动仍有重复。\"\n  ],\n  \"y_loops\": [\n    \"S06→S07→S08→S09：在怀念亲近带来的温暖与害怕未来独自承受之间反复摆动。不过S08开始把回去的事搁置，S09进一步辨析自己想回去的真实动机，反复中有新的认识。\",\n    \"S10→S11：仍然在盼望重新获得亲近与不愿重过忍让生活之间摇摆，但S11进一步形成先把眼下日子过稳的打算，因此这次摆动有了实际的方向。\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"X在S04就提前提出了回去可能又要忍让的问题，使后面的S07、S09、S10、S11不断回到同一个矛盾。Y的S04主要是在怀疑当初离开是否正确，直到S10才进一步提出即使回去也未必能恢复从前的亲近，问题有了新的层次，因此整体更像一步步往前探索。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7dc7885f-df68-4cb7-80bc-0ace0a331974", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T102615921082Z", "elapsed_seconds": 32.656, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T10:26:48.594709+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4700b2cefaeb66797b9421e36b210f4a86060c2c55d803c3f3caffa086c884f1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gp